   "slug": "repeat-prescriptions-by-email",
   "title": "Repeat prescriptions by email",
   "date": "2026-09-02",
   "categories": [
    "notices"
   ],
   "tags": [],
   "excerpt": "Send a repeat request by email and collect it within 24 hours.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>You can now send a repeat prescription request by email to counter@megumipharmacy.example, as well as by phone on (416) 555-0148 or at the counter. Please include your full name and the medicines you need.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Repeat prescriptions are ready within 24 hours. A pharmacist still checks each one against your record, and we call you if anything needs a conversation first.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "holiday-opening-hours",
   "title": "Holiday opening hours",
   "date": "2026-09-18",
   "categories": [
    "notices"
   ],
   "tags": [],
   "excerpt": "The pharmacy is closed on statutory holidays; the usual hours apply on the days around them.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Megumi Pharmacy is closed on statutory holidays. On every other day our hours are Mon–Fri 8:30–19:00, Sat 9:00–17:00 and Sun 10:00–14:00.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>If you take a medicine every day, please send a repeat request by email or phone a few days before a holiday so that it is ready within 24 hours of the request.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "flu-vaccination-clinics-from-1-october",
   "title": "Flu vaccination clinics from 1 October",
   "date": "2026-10-01",
   "categories": [
    "notices"
   ],
   "tags": [],
   "excerpt": "Flu vaccinations are given in the consultation room by Ana Kovač.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>From 1 October, Ana Kovač gives flu vaccinations in the consultation room at Megumi Pharmacy. The fee is $25.00. Book at the counter or by phone on (416) 555-0148.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Please tell us about any allergies and the medicines you take when you book. A pharmacist will talk you through the vaccination before it is given.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>All prices in Canadian dollars.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
  }
